    {
      "cn_text": "当法院处理社会政策决定时,其所制定的法律不可避免地具有政治性——这正是按意识形态立场分裂的裁决极易被斥为不公的原因。",
      "en_text": "When the court deals with social policy decisions, the law it shapes is inescapably political — which is why decisions split along ideological lines are so easily dismissed as unjust.",
